{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S11等短停留段仍有较长的感受描述，扫读速度不如X直接，容易让观众来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然文字更多，但话语按心理转折拆开，并用加亮短语突出每段的关键变化，人物为什么怀念、为什么抗拒、为什么最终选择向前，因果关系更容易跟住。感受也不只是情绪标签，而是落实到具体的声音、身体反应、记忆和音乐变化，并通过到时出现加强了与乐句的对应，因此细腻度和前后连贯性明显胜过X。X的优势是扫一眼就能抓到几个情绪词，但这些词彼此之间的关系和情绪发生的过程，需要观众自己补足。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cc60daaa-a52f-4ccb-9df5-a78941ac6ed6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T064439968774Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:45:20.195892+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fa22d4a68fb9e8b935ec88b04d785ae519035a5e415fbd9ebcf3e5e2f0f41920", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g